---
title: ":jack_o_lantern: Pumpkin Risotto"
source: Recipe Box
servings: 4
prep time: 10 minutes
cook time: 30 minutes
total time: 40 minutes
tags:
  - main
  - risotto
  - pumpkin
  - italian
  - recipe-box
  - vegetarian
---

In a #saucepan{}, bring @vegetable broth{3.5%cups} to a boil, then reduce heat to keep at a gentle simmer.

In a separate #large saucepan{}, heat @olive oil{4%tsp}. Sauté chopped @onion{1} and minced @garlic clove{1} until softened.

Add @Arborio rice{1%cup} and stir until translucent around edges, about 1 to ~{2%minutes}.

Add @dry white wine{1%cup} and stir until absorbed.

Add simmering vegetable broth, about 1/2 cup at a time, stirring frequently until liquid is absorbed before adding more, about 18 to ~{20%minutes}.

Stir in @pumpkin puree{1%cup}, grated @Parmesan cheese{1/4%cup}, @brown sugar{1%Tbsp}, @ground cinnamon{1/4%tsp}, and @salt{1/4%tsp}.

Sprinkle with @ground nutmeg{1/8%tsp} and serve warm.
